  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to see the ability to layer reference cameras in worlds.\n\nThis is some examples of how it could be used.\n\n- Being able to layer post processing in worlds for more control over how things are rendered.\n\n- Refraction that only refracts what is specified in the layers.\n\nThere are some drawbacks to this such as performance hits and having the layers render over things unnaturally if not taken into consideration. I feel like there is more control with having the ability to layer cameras though in worlds.",
